# 03 Homelab Setup

---------------------------

To turn the prework into a valid project, I am planning to manipulate an ICMP packet
and send it from a laptop running Kali Linux to a laptop running Windows 11.
Wireshark will be running on the Windows 11 machine to capture the incoming traffic
directly on the target system, which reflects the concept of host-based monitoring.
I am going into this experiment with the following questions:

- How does the attacker use ICMP for his actions and what does he accomplish by doing so?
- What Indicators of Compromise can the defender use to detect the attack?
- What defenses does the attacker have to overcome and on which OSI layer do they operate?
